"Jiguang, the Aurora of the North, is the Earth Spirit beneath the Howling Fang Mountains."
"Jiguang appears as a towering silver-haired woman with slate-grey, starlit eyes."
"Jiguang has no bonded contractor, so she moves and reacts only slowly, glacially."
"Jiguang can taste a cultivator's intent and feelings across thousands of li."
"Jiguang severed some of her Dragon Veins to the Azure Hills to stop a Qi drain."
"Jiguang knew the gold Qi in Bi De as kin to a fellow spirit, left him a boon and wiped his memory."
"A hidden, illusion-cloaked cave near the mountain's base was once a fox girls' clubhouse."
"Carvings in the hidden den prove human children once lived with the foxes on the mountain."
